        "A theme page is an account focused on a defined topic or audience. The examples in the transcript include:\n- Business.\n- Motivation.\n- Basketball.\n- AI.\n- Crypto.\nThe founder initially tested three themes: business, motivational content, and basketball. The basketball page reportedly gained the most early traction, but the founder chose to focus on the business niche after noticing more apparent monetisation potential there.\n2.1 The experiment behind the theme pages\nThe initial strategy was straightforward:\n1. Create several accounts in different niches.\n2. Publish content in each.\n3. Observe which account attracts attention.\n4. Compare the audience and commercial potential.\n5. Focus on the most promising direction.\nThis is a form of market testing. It can be useful to compare audience response before investing heavily in one content direction.",
