        "A strong month can result from:\n- A temporary wave of demand.\n- A few large customers.\n- A launch or one-off project.\n- A platform algorithm change.\n- A lucky market environment.\n- An unusually intense period of founder effort.\nIt does not automatically demonstrate that the business can reproduce the same result.",
