        "- [ ] Signed agreement / clear written scope.\n- [ ] Payment terms confirmed.\n- [ ] Client goals documented.\n- [ ] Relevant access provided securely.\n- [ ] Required information collected.\n- [ ] Communication channel agreed.\n- [ ] Responsibilities assigned.\n- [ ] Timeline confirmed.\n- [ ] Success measures agreed.\n- [ ] Escalation route defined.\n- [ ] First review scheduled."
